# Design Style: Minimal / Swiss

Clarity through grid, type, and restraint. Content is the interface. If an element doesn't help the user read or act, remove it.

## Principles
1. Typography does the heavy lifting: size, weight, and spacing create hierarchy, not decoration.
2. Everything aligns to a grid. No arbitrary positioning.
3. Generous whitespace is a feature. Never fill space just because it's empty.
4. Flat. No shadows, gradients, blurs, or glows. Borders are 1px hairlines.
5. One accent color, used sparingly for actions and key information only.
6. Asymmetric, left-aligned layouts are preferred over centered ones.

## Design tokens (use CSS variables / Tailwind theme; never hardcode)
```css
:root {
  --bg: #FFFFFF;
  --surface: #F5F5F5;       /* rare; only for subtle grouping */
  --text: #111111;
  --text-muted: #6B6B6B;
  --border: #E2E2E2;
  --accent: #E10600;        /* single accent: swap per brand, keep only one */
  --accent-contrast: #FFFFFF;

  --font-sans: "Inter", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  --radius: 0px;            /* square corners; max 2px if softening is required */

  /* 4px base spacing scale */
  --space-1: 4px;  --space-2: 8px;  --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px;
  --space-6: 24px; --space-8: 32px; --space-12: 48px; --space-16: 64px; --space-24: 96px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root { --bg:#0E0E0E; --surface:#1A1A1A; --text:#F2F2F2; --text-muted:#9A9A9A; --border:#2C2C2C; }
}
```

## Typography
- One typeface family (sans-serif). Use weight (400/500/700) for contrast.
- Scale: 12 / 14 / 16 / 24 / 40 / 64 px. Display headings may go large (64px+) with tight tracking (-0.02em) and line-height 1.05-1.1.
- Body: 16px, line-height 1.5, max line length 60-70ch.
- Left-aligned, ragged-right. Never justify. Avoid ALL CAPS except small labels (12px, +0.08em tracking).

## Layout
- 12-column grid, 24px gutters, max content width 1200px.
- Use asymmetry: e.g., a 4-col label column beside an 8-col content column.
- Section spacing: 96px+ on desktop, 64px on mobile.
- Mobile-first; collapse to a single column with unchanged hierarchy.

## Components
- **Buttons:** Primary = solid `--accent` or `--text` fill, `--radius`, 12px 20px padding, no shadow. Secondary = 1px `--text` border, transparent. Hover = invert or darken 8%, no movement/scale.
- **Inputs:** 1px bottom border or full 1px border, no fill, no radius. Focus = 2px `--text` outline offset 2px.
- **Cards:** No shadow. Separate with a 1px border or whitespace only. Prefer lists and rules over boxed cards.
- **Dividers:** 1px `--border` hairlines to structure sections.
- **Navigation:** Plain text links, active state = underline or bold. No pills, no icon-only nav without labels.
- **Imagery:** Full-bleed or grid-aligned, high contrast, no rounded corners, no decorative overlays.
- **Icons:** Sparse. Use 1.5px stroke line icons only when they add meaning.

## Motion
- Minimal and functional: 120-180ms ease-out opacity/color transitions only. No bounces, parallax, or scroll-jacking. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Accessibility
- Text contrast >= 4.5:1 (7:1 for body when possible). Visible focus states always. Hit targets >= 44px.

## Don't
- No drop shadows, gradients, glassmorphism, glows, or emoji decoration.
- No more than one accent color. No more than two font weights per view beyond headings.
- No centered hero text blocks unless explicitly requested.
- Don't introduce new colors/sizes outside the tokens above; extend tokens first.
